title: Shadow Storage Resized to Delete Copies
id: 43ad3b41-8942-4d74-9f1a-65856da903cd
status: experimental
description: Detects vssadmin resize shadowstorage to a tiny size, which forces deletion of existing volume shadow copies, an alternative recovery-inhibition technique to outright deletion used by ransomware.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1490/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\vssadmin.exe'
    CommandLine|contains|all:
      - 'resize'
      - 'shadowstorage'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Administrators managing shadow storage
level: high
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1490
